      "kind": "concept",
      "name": "Advantage Basketball",
      "call": "“Keep it!”",
      "summary": "Once we create an advantage — we beat a man, or the defense has to help — the next action has to keep it. Drive, kick, swing. Don't hold it.",
      "keys": [
        "Catch with your feet ready to shoot, drive or pass",
        "Make your decision in half a second",
        "A good shot now beats a great shot later only if the advantage is gone"
